  "title": "Tigh's Best Ducati Motorcycle Trips",
  "body": "\n<div>\n<div>\nMy name is Tigh, and I&#x27;ve been incredibly lucky over the past few years,  exploring one of my greatest passions in life, traveling across the world on a motorcycle.  I write about <a href=\"https://www.nyducati.com/\">riding Ducati bikes in and out of New York City</a>, but amazingly enough, I&#x27;ve also had the chance to ride through Italy, Switzerland, Canada, Turkey and all around the United States. <br>\n<br>\nHere are a few of my favorite trips, accompanied by some pictures I&#x27;ve had the chance to take along the way...<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.nyducati.com/p/california-west-coast.html\"><br></a>\n<h2>\n<a href=\"https://www.nyducati.com/p/california-west-coast.html\">West Coast and California on an 821 Ducati Hyperstrada</a></h2>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh2SkVfaEd4GMxB20x7tBklDP2dZeoypXxUT5UdYSoRT33wv30VXnov6vF6B2iNKVF5n1qyGBd5iLVcHJ5ywMsViarlqyGUdFMGhsMm3Oym2rgqmvPfRYHcXsF0I3qJh-DcjxRQ6TGubGmI/s1600/IMG_3512.JPG\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh2SkVfaEd4GMxB20x7tBklDP2dZeoypXxUT5UdYSoRT33wv30VXnov6vF6B2iNKVF5n1qyGBd5iLVcHJ5ywMsViarlqyGUdFMGhsMm3Oym2rgqmvPfRYHcXsF0I3qJh-DcjxRQ6TGubGmI/s1600/IMG_3512.JPG\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<div>\n<br></div>\n</div>\n<h2>\n<a href=\"https://www.nyducati.com/p/tighs-motorcycle-trips-museo-ducati-in.html\">Museo Ducati in Borgo Panigale</a></h2>\n<h2>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://www.nyducati.com/p/tighs-motorcycle-trips-museo-ducati-in.html\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiVWF3bWokB_tDzmR5AkTM3JBJPbzGhm8p0qiNU6A4HUjZer2f__6e_0AOE2blxbX2vVr4Eg97sd8jHCpiZ_K6V5JCY-Xm3uksYwpN1SSlZ4wz6_u6oN7LpoNR4jwAPcaEd_RDZQC9IFpE7/s1600/DSCN2156.JPG\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiVWF3bWokB_tDzmR5AkTM3JBJPbzGhm8p0qiNU6A4HUjZer2f__6e_0AOE2blxbX2vVr4Eg97sd8jHCpiZ_K6V5JCY-Xm3uksYwpN1SSlZ4wz6_u6oN7LpoNR4jwAPcaEd_RDZQC9IFpE7/s1600/DSCN2156.JPG\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Tigho NYDucati: Museo Ducati in Borgo Panigale\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<a href=\"https://www.nyducati.com/p/tighs-motorcycle-trips-italy-switzerland.html\">Lakes Region between Italy and Switzerland</a></h2>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://www.nyducati.com/p/tighs-motorcycle-trips-italy-switzerland.html\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEik8v_99MyZO8IVqSZrK1sIgNYtA5LPLWWPmY1NJ5qh48fTfxPTYr6jWC-HZrUX5Ox1stwZfCWsrNGr48Ibr8vD-8ZJu-Ly6DcuX5Xx8Ev4O2WPlRQ1qkMUHFevXUEG5JQF0fy9LSTfuEdf/s1600/IMG_4836.JPG\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Tigho NYDucati: Lakes Region between Italy and Switzerland\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<h2>\n<a href=\"https://www.nyducati.com/p/tighs-motorcycle-trips-riding-istanbul.html\">Riding Istanbul in the Rain: Turkey by Motorcycle</a><div>\n<a href=\"https://www.nyducati.com/p/tighs-motorcycle-trips-riding-istanbul.html\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiiprkzGnP-1bCsyWn4L8G-lSI7m4UOb1WfxEA-aFVPY4p32cpQksy4CffrtjTaRoPqw_ge97kslU8hiQdwvPSAb_eXOK6H5D0MNKxxCdx_O0Mjw7g2vwBnZTUfajzIozfNpv7WIT_brPth/s1600/12319402_752465032530_755135639_n.jpg\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiiprkzGnP-1bCsyWn4L8G-lSI7m4UOb1WfxEA-aFVPY4p32cpQksy4CffrtjTaRoPqw_ge97kslU8hiQdwvPSAb_eXOK6H5D0MNKxxCdx_O0Mjw7g2vwBnZTUfajzIozfNpv7WIT_brPth/s1600/12319402_752465032530_755135639_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Tigho NYDucati: Riding Istanbul in the Rain with Sinan Soyalp and Barlas Gunay Turkey by Motorcycle\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<a href=\"https://www.nyducati.com/p/tighs-motorcycle-trips-nova-scotia.html\">Nova Scotia: 2500 Miles around the Cabot Trail</a><div>\n<a href=\"https://www.nyducati.com/p/tighs-motorcycle-trips-nova-scotia.html\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgtxbQEu3TuUX6ZvD2vEz6q7IQopThGKIYbNDWJ7WtQ9pDKdFjmFmeSenUc1HFtcHTCeLezS6-q93oR4e